# ripple dashes, t/T 4x4 Bayer band, T below) and two steep-roofed boathouses
# on stilts (o/n plank walls, n/R roof, j boat opening with a small c/o boat,
# d attic window 2x3). Near-layer colours only, no k, no outlines (art-style 7).
# Drawn by the pixel-artist with a throwaway script; the grid below is the
# source. Tiles horizontally (640 px).
